sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Py as Python BranchSession
  participant Native as NativeBranchSession
  participant Meta as Metadata Store<br/>SQLite/PostgreSQL
  participant Data as Data Store<br/>PG/SQLite/DuckDB

  User->>Py: session.query("SELECT ...")
  Py->>Native: query(sql, params)
  Native->>Meta: prepare/read cached branch segment + table registry
  Meta-->>Native: segment_id, branch_point, physical table map
  Native->>Native: parse/rewrite SELECT
  Native->>Data: SELECT ... FROM physical_table<br/>WHERE live_lo <= branch_point<br/>AND branch_point < live_hi<br/>AND deleted = false
  Data-->>Native: visible rows
  Native-->>Py: rows
  Py-->>User: rows
